     1,
     "\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<div lang=\"EN-AU\" link=\"blue\" vlink=\"purple\">\r\n\r\n<div>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><font size=\"2\" color=\"navy\" face=\"Arial\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:Arial;color:navy\">Hi  ?,</span></font></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><font size=\"2\" color=\"navy\" face=\"Arial\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:Arial;color:navy\"> </span></font></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><font size=\"2\" color=\"navy\" face=\"Arial\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:Arial;color:navy\">It would be nice if you signed your email\r\nwith a name, it makes the list a little more friendly.</span></font></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><font size=\"2\" color=\"navy\" face=\"Arial\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:Arial;color:navy\"> </span></font></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><font size=\"2\" color=\"navy\" face=\"Arial\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:Arial;color:navy\">Can you please state your rattle version\r\nnumber, as well as your operating system.</span></font></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><font size=\"2\" color=\"navy\" face=\"Arial\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:Arial;color:navy\"> </span></font></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><font size=\"2\" color=\"navy\" face=\"Arial\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:Arial;color:navy\">Are you able to get a snapshot of the\r\nerror or an error message.</span></font></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><font size=\"2\" color=\"navy\" face=\"Arial\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:Arial;color:navy\"> </span></font></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><font size=\"2\" color=\"navy\" face=\"Arial\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:Arial;color:navy\">Are you loading Rattle first and every\r\ntime, after starting R, or are you conducting R commands before hand?</span></font></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><font size=\"2\" color=\"navy\" face=\"Arial\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:Arial;color:navy\"> </span></font></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><font size=\"2\" color=\"navy\" face=\"Arial\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:Arial;color:navy\">Are you following the same sequence each\r\ntime you start R and then Rattle. For instance, have you restarted your\r\ncomputer and then run R, or are you using R and Rattle at the end of a long\r\nsequence of other applications, which leaves shadows on the memory bus and\r\nperhaps you need to reboot to clear the memory.</span></font></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><font size=\"2\" color=\"navy\" face=\"Arial\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:Arial;color:navy\"> </span></font></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><font size=\"2\" color=\"navy\" face=\"Arial\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:Arial;color:navy\">Some times I also find I have to reinstall\r\nRattle, to have a fresh version when it faults.</span></font></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><font size=\"2\" color=\"navy\" face=\"Arial\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:Arial;color:navy\"> </span></font></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><font size=\"2\" color=\"navy\" face=\"Arial\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:Arial;color:navy\">Regards</span></font></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><font size=\"2\" color=\"navy\" face=\"Arial\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:Arial;color:navy\">Tony</span></font></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><font size=\"2\" color=\"navy\" face=\"Arial\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:Arial;color:navy\"> </span></font></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><font size=\"2\" color=\"navy\" face=\"Arial\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:Arial;color:navy\"> </span></font></p>\r\n\r\n<div>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"MsoNormal\" align=\"center\" style=\"text-align:center\"><font size=\"3\" face=\"Times New Roman\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt\">\r\n\r\n<hr size=\"2\" width=\"100%\" align=\"center\">\r\n\r\n</span></font></div>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><font size=\"2\" face=\"Tahoma\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:Tahoma;font-weight:bold\">From:</span></font></b><font size=\"2\" face=\"Tahoma\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:Tahoma\">\r\n<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">rattle...@googlegroups.com</a> [mailto:<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">rattle...@googlegroups.com</a>] <b><span style=\"font-weight:bold\">On Behalf Of </span></b>???<br>\r\n<b><span style=\"font-weight:bold\">Sent:</span></b> Wednesday, 27 August 2008\r\n09:15<br>\r\n<b><span style=\"font-weight:bold\">To:</span></b> rattle-users<br>\r\n<b><span style=\"font-weight:bold\">Subject:</span></b> R GUI error</span></font></p>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><font size=\"3\" face=\"Times New Roman\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"> </span></font></p>\r\n\r\n<div>\r\n\r\n<div>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><font size=\"3\" face=\"Times New Roman\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\">Whenever I try to excute Rgui.exe, however   occur error.</span></font></p>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n<div>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><font size=\"3\" face=\"Times New Roman\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"> </span></font></p>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n<div>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><font size=\"3\" face=\"Times New Roman\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\">Sometimes, this error occured in RATTLE Processing.</span></font></p>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n<div>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><font size=\"3\" face=\"Times New Roman\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"> </span></font></p>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n<div>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><font size=\"3\" face=\"Times New Roman\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\">Pls let me know if you know this error.</span></font></p>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n<div>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><font size=\"3\" face=\"Times New Roman\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"> </span></font></p>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n<div>\r\n